8.1 Introduction

The Project Demonstration Phase presents the completed ComicCraft application and explains its purpose, features, technologies, workflow, and output.

A demonstration video should be recorded with screen sharing and the student's voice-over. It should be uploaded to Google Drive with access configured to allow anyone with the link to view it.

