8.4 Demo Video Script
Writing

1. Introduction

Good morning everyone.

We are here to present our project titled "ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models."

Our project is an AI-based web application that generates personalized comic stories and illustrations using Artificial Intelligence.

2. Purpose of the Project

The main purpose of our project is to simplify the comic creation process. Creating comics manually requires storytelling, drawing skills, and considerable time.

Our application helps users transform their creative ideas into illustrated comic stories using AI.

3. Technologies Used

We developed this project using Python and FastAPI for the backend, HTML and CSS for the frontend, and Jinja2 for dynamic webpage rendering.

We use Gemini AI models for story generation and Stable Diffusion for creating comic illustrations. FPDF is used to export the final comic into PDF format.

4. Working Process

First, the user enters a story prompt, character name, setting, tone, and preferred art style.

After submitting the form, the application generates a structured comic outline using Gemini Flash. Gemini Pro then generates detailed narration and character dialogues.

Next, Stable Diffusion generates illustrations for the comic panels. The backend organizes the text and images into a structured comic layout and displays the result on the preview page.

5. Project Demonstration

Now, we will demonstrate how the ComicCraft application works.

We enter a sample story prompt, choose the character details, select the setting, tone, and art style, and submit the form.

The application processes the input and generates the comic panels. We can view the illustrations, panel titles, narration, and dialogues on the comic preview page.

We can then use the PDF export option to save the completed comic.

6. Benefits

ComicCraft simplifies comic creation, reduces manual effort, and makes AI-assisted storytelling accessible to users without advanced drawing skills.

It can be used for creative storytelling, educational content, and personal comic projects.

7. Conclusion

To conclude, ComicCraft combines AI-based story generation, image generation, and PDF export in a single web application.

This project demonstrates how Artificial Intelligence can support creativity and make digital comic creation easier.

Thank you.

